    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Bug Bunny: Discontroll\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a nightmarish abandoned school, you must control a haunted doll through an unfamiliar system and escape from a terrifying clown in this survival horror adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with no memory\u2014only to find yourself wandering a dark, distorted school building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743120/extras/3e885d80e5b80fadc75e17d1eec3f053.avif?t=1754638124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your body won\u2019t move the way you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clown you don\u2019t recognize chases you relentlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And scattered around you are fragments of something forgotten\u2014your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743120/extras/fb297fc0915674c91935f7dda3cb9a12.avif?t=1754638124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Unfamiliar, Restrictive Controls</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling a fragile doll isn\u2019t as easy as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The awkward movements heighten your fear and panic, especially when fleeing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a core part of what makes Mellon so tense and unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Hide, Distract, Outsmart</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl under desks, hide inside lockers, or use items to create distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade your pursuer using context-sensitive actions as you search for the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Randomly Generated School Layouts</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough features a newly generated version of the abandoned school\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changing classrooms, corridors, and layouts to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Collect Lost Memories</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the school are two kinds of memory fragments:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Innocent Memories&quot; and &quot;Corrupted Memories.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering them might change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But who do these memories belong to?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And will they bring salvation\u2014or punishment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743120/extras/cc787e1a8b37af90a460a4978c95b9c5.avif?t=1754638124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Recommended For\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy unique and unconventional control schemes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of psychological, atmospheric horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who crave intense, skill-based escape experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorers who like piecing together hidden stories through multiple playthroughs</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Bug Bunny: Discontroll\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a nightmarish abandoned school, you must control a haunted doll through an unfamiliar system and escape from a terrifying clown in this survival horror adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with no memory\u2014only to find yourself wandering a dark, distorted school building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743120/extras/3e885d80e5b80fadc75e17d1eec3f053.avif?t=1754638124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your body won\u2019t move the way you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clown you don\u2019t recognize chases you relentlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And scattered around you are fragments of something forgotten\u2014your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743120/extras/fb297fc0915674c91935f7dda3cb9a12.avif?t=1754638124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Unfamiliar, Restrictive Controls</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling a fragile doll isn\u2019t as easy as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The awkward movements heighten your fear and panic, especially when fleeing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a core part of what makes Mellon so tense and unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Hide, Distract, Outsmart</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl under desks, hide inside lockers, or use items to create distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade your pursuer using context-sensitive actions as you search for the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Randomly Generated School Layouts</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough features a newly generated version of the abandoned school\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >changing classrooms, corridors, and layouts to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <u>Collect Lost Memories</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the school are two kinds of memory fragments:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Innocent Memories&quot; and &quot;Corrupted Memories.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gathering them might change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But who do these memories belong to?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And will they bring salvation\u2014or punishment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743120/extras/cc787e1a8b37af90a460a4978c95b9c5.avif?t=1754638124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Recommended For\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy unique and unconventional control schemes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of psychological, atmospheric horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who crave intense, skill-based escape experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorers who like piecing together hidden stories through multiple playthroughs</p>",
